1
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:07,150
Zankoku na tenshi no you ni

2
00:00:00,980 --> 00:00:07,150
Just like the cruel angel

3
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:15,110
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

4
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:15,110
Young boy, become a legend

5
00:00:18,990 --> 00:00:22,790
2D4U PRESENTS:

6
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:26,000
Aoi kaze ga ima

7
00:00:22,790 --> 00:00:26,000
Even though the untested breeze...

8
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,800
mune no doa o tataitemo

9
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:29,800
...taps at the door to your heart

10
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:37,470
Watashi dake o tada mitsumete hohoenderu anata

11
00:00:29,800 --> 00:00:37,550
You just look solely at me and smile

12
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:44,730
Sotto fureru mono motomeru koto ni muchuu de

13
00:00:37,550 --> 00:00:44,730
So intent on seeking out that gentle touch

14
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:52,070
Unmei sae mada shiranai itaike na hitomi

15
00:00:44,730 --> 00:00:52,070
Such innocent eyes, still ignorant of their destiny

16
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:55,950
Dakedo itsuka kizuku deshou

17
00:00:52,070 --> 00:00:55,950
But someday, you are sure to realize...

18
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:58,870
sono senaka ni wa

19
00:00:55,950 --> 00:00:58,870
...that upon your back

20
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:03,160
Haruka mirai mezasu tame

21
00:00:59,530 --> 00:01:03,160
You have the wings with which to fly...

22
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:06,830
no hane ga aru koto

23
00:01:03,160 --> 00:01:06,960
...towards the distant future

24
00:01:06,960 --> 00:01:10,960
Zankoku na tenshi no teeze

25
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:10,960
The cruel angel's thesis

26
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:14,630
Madobe kara yagate tobidatsu

27
00:01:10,960 --> 00:01:14,630
Soon, you will take flight from the windowsill

28
00:01:14,630 --> 00:01:18,470
Hotobashiru atsui patosu de

29
00:01:14,630 --> 00:01:18,470
With your torrent of ardent pathos

30
00:01:18,470 --> 00:01:21,970
Omoide o uragiru nara

31
00:01:18,470 --> 00:01:21,970
If you are to betray our memories

32
00:01:21,970 --> 00:01:25,730
Kono sora o daite kagayaku

33
00:01:21,970 --> 00:01:25,730
You, who embrace these heavens and shine

34
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:29,770
Shounen yo shinwa ni nare

35
00:01:25,730 --> 00:01:29,770
Young boy, become a legend

36
00:01:31,070 --> 00:01:33,650
The hypothetical became reality.

37
00:01:33,650 --> 00:01:37,360
Talk about unlucky, the proponent
becoming the test subject herself.

38
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:41,030
Then, that contact experiment
was the direct cause?

39
00:01:41,030 --> 00:01:44,120
Mental breakdown, that was
the result of the contact.

40
00:01:44,120 --> 00:01:47,960
But how cruel is it to commit suicide,
leaving such a young daughter behind?

41
00:01:47,960 --> 00:01:51,970
No, there might actually be
more to this than that.

42
00:01:53,010 --> 00:01:57,930
Asuka, dear, your mom cooked
your favorite dish today.

43
00:01:57,930 --> 00:02:02,430
Come on, if you're picky about your food,
that big girl over there is going to laugh at you.

44
00:02:02,430 --> 00:02:04,470
She goes on like that every day.

45
00:02:04,470 --> 00:02:07,060
She talks to the doll, thinking it's her daughter.

46
00:02:07,060 --> 00:02:09,980
She probably feels responsible in her own way.

47
00:02:09,980 --> 00:02:13,900
Her research filled her days and she had no time
to pay attention to our daughter.

48
00:02:14,150 --> 00:02:16,440
You have my sympathies.

49
00:02:16,440 --> 00:02:19,200
But the way she is, they're
practically a family of dolls.

50
00:02:19,200 --> 00:02:23,440
No, perhaps humans and dolls
are not so different.

51
00:02:23,440 --> 00:02:28,640
Humans made dolls in their own image.

52
00:02:28,640 --> 00:02:33,540
If God exists, we may be nothing more
than dolls to Him.

53
00:02:33,540 --> 00:02:37,490
I'm surprised to hear such words from
a practitioner of modern medicine.

54
00:02:37,490 --> 00:02:42,230
I'm just another human before I'm a doctor,
a flesh and blood woman.

55
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:57,230
You're such a good girl, Asuka.

56
00:02:57,230 --> 00:02:59,110
It's okay, you don't have to hold it in, you know?

57
00:02:59,110 --> 00:03:03,330
It's okay. I'm not going to cry.
I'm going to think for myself.

58
00:03:04,960 --> 00:03:06,540
Can you hear me, Asuka?

59
00:03:06,540 --> 00:03:08,200
Your synch rate is down by eight points.

60
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:10,210
As always, keep your mind off other things.

61
00:03:10,210 --> 00:03:11,080
I'm doing it!

62
00:03:11,080 --> 00:03:14,000
EPISODE 22
AT LEAST, BE HUMAN

63
00:03:14,970 --> 00:03:18,960
Asuka's synch rate has been
on a downward trend lately.

64
00:03:18,960 --> 00:03:21,930
It's problematic, considering our tight situation.

65
00:03:21,930 --> 00:03:24,300
Let's make Rei's Unit 00 our priority.

66
00:03:24,300 --> 00:03:27,560
Right now, we don't have the leeway
to repair both at the same time.

67
00:03:29,820 --> 00:03:33,730
Mitosis in Unit 02's left arm has
cleared the target value.

68
00:03:33,730 --> 00:03:36,990
Necrosis is currently under
point zero five percent.

69
00:03:36,990 --> 00:03:39,530
The apoptosis process is operating normally.

70
00:03:39,780 --> 00:03:43,160
Unit 00's morphogenetic system
is currently stable.

71
00:03:43,160 --> 00:03:46,540
Please connect receptors to Signal 2.

72
00:03:48,880 --> 00:03:52,170
The Eva series, born from Adam.

73
00:03:52,170 --> 00:03:56,460
We even have to make use of what
caused the Second Impact

74
00:03:56,460 --> 00:03:58,300
in order for us to win against the Angels.

75
00:03:58,550 --> 00:04:00,590
Put it another way, in order to live,

76
00:04:00,590 --> 00:04:03,880
we will even use the thing
that tried to wipe us out.

77
00:04:03,880 --> 00:04:06,020
I guess that's what humans do.

78
00:04:06,020 --> 00:04:09,390
In the end, maybe I do hate the Eva.

79
00:04:09,390 --> 00:04:11,230
My father's murderer...

80
00:04:11,230 --> 00:04:13,150
Miss Katsuragi!

81
00:04:13,530 --> 00:04:16,730
Construction of Evas up through
Unit 13 has begun?

82
00:04:16,730 --> 00:04:18,520
In seven different locations around the world?

83
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:20,280
This information came via Shanghai.

84
00:04:20,280 --> 00:04:22,110
The source can be trusted.

85
00:04:22,110 --> 00:04:24,610
Why are they rushing mass production
at this stage?

86
00:04:24,610 --> 00:04:28,660
We've lost two Evas in the past and
two are currently heavily damaged.

87
00:04:28,660 --> 00:04:30,620
Perhaps they're rushing
to reinforce our reserves

88
00:04:30,620 --> 00:04:32,160
with an eye towards the
secondary preparations.

89
00:04:32,160 --> 00:04:33,790
I don't know.

90
00:04:33,790 --> 00:04:36,170
Even here, we're getting Germany
to give us pans

91
00:04:36,170 --> 00:04:38,720
from Unit 05 and 06 that are
being built there.

92
00:04:38,720 --> 00:04:41,800
There seems to be a lot of money
changing hands lately.

93
00:04:41,800 --> 00:04:44,380
Our budget was doubled since
we came here after all.

94
00:04:44,380 --> 00:04:47,510
Do you suppose that just shows
how desperate the higher-ups are?

95
00:04:47,510 --> 00:04:50,560
I sense a certain impatience on
the part of the Committee.

96
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:53,520
Then are they anticipating a case
where not single,

97
00:04:53,520 --> 00:04:57,100
but multiple Angels are deployed
against us at once?

98
00:04:57,100 --> 00:05:02,120
Maybe, but there's no reason to do it unofficially.

99
00:05:02,120 --> 00:05:04,700
They must have some other objective in mind.

100
00:05:24,970 --> 00:05:29,310
All three of us are here for once
and we're just so awkward.

101
00:05:31,610 --> 00:05:33,400
I'm done.

102
00:05:34,980 --> 00:05:36,020
Asuka!

103
00:05:36,020 --> 00:05:39,190
No way! It's just going to be
another call from Kaji for you!

104
00:05:39,190 --> 00:05:41,070
You answer it!

105
00:05:41,070 --> 00:05:43,160
That's not likely.

106
00:05:48,710 --> 00:05:52,450
Oh, my, the great invincible Shinji,
lowering himself to such a menial chore.

107
00:05:52,450 --> 00:05:54,410
Thank you so very much.

108
00:05:54,410 --> 00:05:56,480
Yes, hello?

109
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:59,220
What's with his prissy attitude?

110
00:06:01,510 --> 00:06:04,210
An international call from Germany for you.

111
00:06:04,210 --> 00:06:05,550
It's your mother.

112
00:06:05,550 --> 00:06:08,110
For me? From Mom?

113
00:06:08,110 --> 00:06:10,060
Give it here!

114
00:06:15,610 --> 00:06:18,350
When she's talking in a language
I don't understand,

115
00:06:18,350 --> 00:06:20,820
it's like she becomes a total stranger.

116
00:06:32,540 --> 00:06:34,630
A mother?

117
00:06:46,510 --> 00:06:48,880
You sure talked for a long time.

118
00:06:48,880 --> 00:06:51,930
Well, it's our usual bit of communication.

119
00:06:51,930 --> 00:06:54,010
It must be nice to have a family to talk to.

120
00:06:54,010 --> 00:06:57,230
Well, just in appearance. It's only on the surface.

121
00:06:57,230 --> 00:06:59,350
She's not my real mother anyway.

122
00:07:00,110 --> 00:07:02,440
But it's not like I hate her.

123
00:07:02,440 --> 00:07:04,690
I just don't deal with her well.

124
00:07:04,690 --> 00:07:07,650
Why the hell am I telling you all this?!

125
00:07:07,650 --> 00:07:09,070
Sorry.

126
00:07:09,070 --> 00:07:13,120
It's all over if even you start
sympathizing with me!

127
00:07:17,250 --> 00:07:20,120
She's at negative twelve point eight
on the synch index,

128
00:07:20,120 --> 00:07:21,960
just barely above the activation level.

129
00:07:21,960 --> 00:07:23,630
That's terrible.

130
00:07:23,630 --> 00:07:25,720
She's dropped off even more than yesterday.

131
00:07:25,720 --> 00:07:29,050
Asuka isn't feeling well today.
She's on her second day.

132
00:07:29,050 --> 00:07:32,850
The synch rate isn't affected by
superficial physical conditions.

133
00:07:32,850 --> 00:07:35,920
The problem lies more in the subconscious.

134
00:07:35,920 --> 00:07:39,480
We may have no choice but to
change the core of Unit 02.

135
00:07:39,480 --> 00:07:41,600
Asuka, you can come up.

136
00:07:41,800 --> 00:07:47,440
<i>Repair work on Power Grid 8 is scheduled to begin at 1800 today.</i>

137
00:07:45,400 --> 00:07:47,650
Asuka's pride is in pieces.

138
00:07:47,650 --> 00:07:50,990
<i>The regular meeting concerning the disposal issue</i>

139
00:07:47,650 --> 00:07:50,990
It's not surprising, considering how she lost.

140
00:07:50,990 --> 00:07:53,160
<i>Of Command Center 1 will be held on schedule.</i>

141
00:07:50,990 --> 00:07:54,660
Or rather, the fact she thinks she lost to Shinji looms larger.

142
00:07:53,160 --> 00:07:56,620
<i>General Affairs managers, please come
to Conference Room 2.</i>

143
00:07:55,620 --> 00:07:59,300
Maybe the three of us living together has reached the limit.

144
00:07:59,300 --> 00:08:01,160
Threshold exceeded?

145
00:08:01,160 --> 00:08:03,510
Is this the end of your merry game of house?

146
00:08:03,510 --> 00:08:08,350
I don't want to hear that from someone who keeps a cat to keep loneliness at bay.

147
00:08:10,350 --> 00:08:13,680
I'm sorry, I guess I'm on edge.

148
00:08:14,390 --> 00:08:19,180
Why do I have to go through this just
because I'm a woman?!

149
00:08:19,180 --> 00:08:22,020
I don't even want kids!

150
00:08:22,020 --> 00:08:26,190
<i>Route Loop 7 is currently closed
due to an accident.</i>

151
00:08:26,190 --> 00:08:29,570
<i>Please use the detour via Route 12.</i>

152
00:09:28,590 --> 00:09:32,090
The Eva won't move unless you open your heart.

153
00:09:32,090 --> 00:09:35,270
Are you saying that my heart is closed?!

154
00:09:35,270 --> 00:09:37,930
Yes, the Evas have souls.

155
00:09:37,930 --> 00:09:39,830
Those puppets?!

156
00:09:39,830 --> 00:09:41,600
You should know that.

157
00:09:41,600 --> 00:09:43,430
Fancy you starting up a conversation!

158
00:09:43,430 --> 00:09:45,780
Maybe it'll snow tomorrow!

159
00:09:46,490 --> 00:09:50,520
What?! Are you so happy that
I can't pilot my Eva?!

160
00:09:50,520 --> 00:09:52,860
There's nothing to worry about!
If another Angel attacks us,

161
00:09:52,860 --> 00:09:56,110
the great, invincible Shinji will
take care of it for us!

162
00:09:56,110 --> 00:09:58,200
We don't have to do anything!

163
00:09:58,360 --> 00:10:01,000
All they need is Shinji!

164
00:10:02,040 --> 00:10:06,290
First, I get Shinji's sympathy, and now,
even from the mechanical puppet girl.

165
00:10:06,290 --> 00:10:09,010
I've really lost my edge.

166
00:10:09,010 --> 00:10:10,500
I am not a puppet.

167
00:10:10,500 --> 00:10:13,340
Shut up! You do whatever you're told!

168
00:10:13,340 --> 00:10:16,380
You'd die if Commander Ikari
told you to, wouldn't you?!

169
00:10:16,380 --> 00:10:18,060
That's right.

170
00:10:20,640 --> 00:10:22,470
You really ARE a puppet!

171
00:10:22,470 --> 00:10:26,020
I've always really hated you because
you're so much like a puppet!

172
00:10:27,400 --> 00:10:30,450
Everyone! I hate everyone!

173
00:10:43,170 --> 00:10:46,000
Shinji didn't show up today either.

174
00:10:46,500 --> 00:10:48,960
Though Ayanami's absence is normal.

175
00:10:48,960 --> 00:10:50,540
Asuka didn't come either.

176
00:10:50,540 --> 00:10:53,180
And Suzuhara's still in the hospital.

177
00:10:53,180 --> 00:10:56,170
I guess school isn't much of a priority right now.

178
00:10:56,170 --> 00:10:58,840
Signal from Eva Unit 02 showing no problems.

179
00:10:58,840 --> 00:11:01,010
VA connection and fusion are normal.

180
00:11:01,010 --> 00:11:03,310
Rate of proliferation is within expected limits.

181
00:11:03,850 --> 00:11:09,320
You're my puppet, so all you have to do
is quietly do as I say!

182
00:11:09,770 --> 00:11:12,440
Why does a weapon need a soul anyway?!

183
00:11:12,440 --> 00:11:14,440
It only gets in the way!

184
00:11:14,630 --> 00:11:18,370
Anyway, all you have to do is obey my orders.

185
00:11:20,410 --> 00:11:22,210
This is so stupid.

186
00:11:24,920 --> 00:11:27,370
All hands, battle stations, level one!

187
00:11:27,370 --> 00:11:29,120
Prepare for anti-air combat!

188
00:11:29,120 --> 00:11:30,840
An Angel?! They're still coming?!

189
00:11:37,350 --> 00:11:39,350
Angel, visually confirmed.

190
00:11:39,350 --> 00:11:41,300
Here is the highest magnification.

191
00:11:41,300 --> 00:11:43,720
It isn't budging from its satellite orbit.

192
00:11:43,720 --> 00:11:46,350
It's maintaining a set distance from our location.

193
00:11:46,350 --> 00:11:49,770
Which means, it's waiting for a chance
to descend and close in,

194
00:11:49,770 --> 00:11:52,480
or it can attack us without the need to do so.

195
00:11:52,480 --> 00:11:54,520
We can't make a careless move at this rate.

196
00:11:54,520 --> 00:11:59,800
Either way, we can't do anything about it
unless the target moves within our firing range.

197
00:11:59,800 --> 00:12:03,360
The Eva units aren't capable of
attacking anything in orbit.

198
00:12:03,710 --> 00:12:04,820
How's Rei?

199
00:12:04,820 --> 00:12:07,330
She's in good shape, along with Unit 00.
She's ready to go.

200
00:12:07,330 --> 00:12:08,410
Roger that.

201
00:12:08,410 --> 00:12:09,790
Launch Unit 00!

202
00:12:09,790 --> 00:12:11,550
Prepare for extreme long range firing.

203
00:12:11,550 --> 00:12:14,830
Unit 02 and Asuka will stand by
for launch as backup!

204
00:12:14,830 --> 00:12:17,790
Backup?! Me?! To Unit 00?!

205
00:12:17,790 --> 00:12:19,760
That's right, take the rear position.

206
00:12:19,760 --> 00:12:23,220
You have got to be joking!
Eva Unit 02, taking off!

207
00:12:24,730 --> 00:12:26,230
Asuka!

208
00:12:27,560 --> 00:12:29,930
That's fine, we'll let her take the lead.

209
00:12:29,930 --> 00:12:31,520
Major Katsuragi!

210
00:12:32,280 --> 00:12:35,270
Meaning, this is the end for Asuka
if she can't perform now.

211
00:12:35,270 --> 00:12:37,200
Her last chance, then?

212
00:12:37,570 --> 00:12:40,980
We'll have to think about
a replacement pilot for Unit 02.

213
00:12:40,980 --> 00:12:41,780
Yes, Ma'am.

214
00:12:41,780 --> 00:12:44,310
Aren't we sending out Unit 01?

215
00:12:44,310 --> 00:12:47,820
It's been put on suspension under
Commander Ikari's strict orders.

216
00:12:49,330 --> 00:12:51,450
I suppose it's not surprising
after what happened.

217
00:12:51,450 --> 00:12:52,830
INSPECTION
DIVISION

218
00:13:12,770 --> 00:13:16,480
If I mess this up, they'll probably
take me off Unit 02.

219
00:13:16,480 --> 00:13:19,070
No mistakes allowed, Asuka.

220
00:13:29,370 --> 00:13:31,870
Target is still outside firing range.

221
00:13:31,870 --> 00:13:35,630
Oh, hurry up and get over here already!
Talk about irritating!

222
00:13:40,040 --> 00:13:41,550
WARNING

223
00:13:42,070 --> 00:13:43,880
Is it a direct energy weapon?!

224
00:13:43,880 --> 00:13:45,670
No, I'm not getting any thermal energy readings.

225
00:13:45,670 --> 00:13:47,220
Her psychograph readings are agitated!

226
00:13:47,220 --> 00:13:49,410
Mental contamination beginning!

227
00:13:49,410 --> 00:13:51,180
The Angel is launching a psychological attack?

228
00:13:51,180 --> 00:13:54,400
They can comprehend the mind
of a human being?

229
00:13:55,730 --> 00:13:58,280
Goddamn it!

230
00:14:02,770 --> 00:14:04,530
Positrons have dissipated!

231
00:14:04,530 --> 00:14:07,040
No good! It's outside the firing range!

232
00:14:16,340 --> 00:14:18,750
Unit 02, out of rifle ammunition!

233
00:14:18,750 --> 00:14:20,170
Analysis of the ray of light?!

234
00:14:20,170 --> 00:14:22,000
It's an energy wave within the visible spectrum!

235
00:14:22,000 --> 00:14:24,920
It's similar to the AT Field,
but details are unknown!

236
00:14:24,920 --> 00:14:25,710
What about Asuka?

237
00:14:25,710 --> 00:14:28,890
She's in danger! The mental
contamination has entered Y!

238
00:14:32,900 --> 00:14:34,890
No!

239
00:14:35,070 --> 00:14:38,060
Don't... Don't come inside me!

240
00:14:38,060 --> 00:14:38,320
It hurts

241
00:14:38,320 --> 00:14:39,860
It hurts!

242
00:14:44,120 --> 00:14:44,370
Don't come in!

243
00:14:44,370 --> 00:14:46,160
It hurts!

244
00:14:49,120 --> 00:14:49,660
Stop it

245
00:14:54,040 --> 00:14:54,490
Don't come inside

246
00:14:57,710 --> 00:14:57,910
No!

247
00:14:57,910 --> 00:14:59,510
No!

248
00:15:01,220 --> 00:15:01,460
It hurts

249
00:15:01,460 --> 00:15:02,760
No!

250
00:15:04,500 --> 00:15:04,540
MOTHER

251
00:15:04,630 --> 00:15:06,220
No!

252
00:15:07,220 --> 00:15:09,590
Don't look inside my mind!

253
00:15:09,590 --> 00:15:12,590
Please! Don't dig deeper into my heart!

254
00:15:12,590 --> 00:15:13,350
Asuka!

255
00:15:13,350 --> 00:15:15,100
Her psychograph readings are at their limit!

256
00:15:15,100 --> 00:15:17,270
Her mental circuits are being torn to shreds.

257
00:15:17,270 --> 00:15:19,230
It'll be too dangerous if they're
overloaded any more.

258
00:15:19,230 --> 00:15:20,440
Asuka, come back!

259
00:15:20,440 --> 00:15:21,600
No!

260
00:15:21,600 --> 00:15:23,310
That's an order! Asuka, retreat!

261
00:15:23,310 --> 00:15:25,110
No! Never!

262
00:15:25,110 --> 00:15:27,900
I'd rather die here than go back now!

263
00:15:27,900 --> 00:15:28,910
Asuka!

264
00:15:28,910 --> 00:15:30,950
Accelerator being aligned.

265
00:15:30,950 --> 00:15:33,110
Voltage increasing, approaching pressurization.

266
00:15:33,110 --> 00:15:34,700
Forced convergence, activated.

267
00:15:34,700 --> 00:15:37,790
Adjusting zero point zero three
for Earth's rotation and gravity.

268
00:15:37,790 --> 00:15:39,960
Superconductive guidance system in operation.

269
00:15:39,960 --> 00:15:41,670
Chamber at maximum pressure.

270
00:15:41,670 --> 00:15:43,120
Final safety released!

271
00:15:43,120 --> 00:15:44,040
Release confirmed.

272
00:15:44,040 --> 00:15:45,880
Everything in launch position!

273
00:15:51,390 --> 00:15:56,010
It's no good! The power level is far too low
to penetrate the AT Field at this range!

274
00:15:56,010 --> 00:15:59,520
But output is at maximum! Anything more is...

275
00:15:59,520 --> 00:16:01,980
Unit 02, psychograph readings
are growing weaker!

276
00:16:01,980 --> 00:16:03,730
What about the LCL's psychological barrier?!

277
00:16:03,730 --> 00:16:06,230
It's no use. It's not even working as a catalyst!

278
00:16:06,230 --> 00:16:09,440
Prioritize life support. Shut out
the feedback from the Eva.

279
00:16:09,440 --> 00:16:10,700
Yes, Ma'am.

280
00:16:11,290 --> 00:16:14,960
It's as if this light is probing Asuka's
psychological wavelength.

281
00:16:15,280 --> 00:16:18,670
Could it be that the Angel is trying
to learn about the human mind?!

282
00:16:27,140 --> 00:16:29,340
Why am I crying?

283
00:16:29,340 --> 00:16:31,680
I already decided I wouldn't cry anymore.

284
00:16:35,310 --> 00:16:37,510
What's the matter, Asuka?

285
00:16:37,510 --> 00:16:41,400
It's a present from your new mom.
Don't you like it?

286
00:16:41,400 --> 00:16:43,060
It's okay.

287
00:16:43,060 --> 00:16:44,690
What's okay?

288
00:16:44,690 --> 00:16:46,350
I'm not a child!

289
00:16:46,350 --> 00:16:47,900
I'm going to grow up quickly.

290
00:16:47,900 --> 00:16:50,190
I don't need stuffed animals.

291
00:16:50,190 --> 00:16:51,820
So look at me!

292
00:16:51,820 --> 00:16:54,650
Mom! Please, don't quit being my mom!

293
00:16:54,650 --> 00:16:56,070
Die with me.

294
00:16:56,070 --> 00:16:59,450
Mom! Mom! Please don't kill me!

295
00:16:59,700 --> 00:17:02,200
No! I'm not your doll!

296
00:17:02,370 --> 00:17:04,580
I'm going to think and live for myself!

297
00:17:04,830 --> 00:17:07,500
I don't need a mom or a dad.
I'm going to live on my own.

298
00:17:07,500 --> 00:17:09,670
No, don't make me remember this!

299
00:17:09,670 --> 00:17:12,380
I'd forgotten about it! Don't dig it up again!

300
00:17:12,380 --> 00:17:14,550
I don't need any of this bad stuff anymore!

301
00:17:14,800 --> 00:17:17,930
Stop it already! Stop it!

302
00:17:18,400 --> 00:17:22,190
My mind's been defiled.

303
00:17:25,240 --> 00:17:28,780
Mr. Kaji, I've been defiled.

304
00:17:29,110 --> 00:17:32,910
What will I do? I've been defiled.

305
00:17:37,960 --> 00:17:39,620
Unit 02 has shut down!

306
00:17:39,620 --> 00:17:41,280
Life support has developed a problem.

307
00:17:41,530 --> 00:17:43,410
Pilot entering a dangerous state!

308
00:17:43,410 --> 00:17:45,160
No change in target.

309
00:17:45,160 --> 00:17:47,210
Relative distance has remained the same.

310
00:17:47,210 --> 00:17:51,880
Probability of it moving within firing range
of Unit 00 is point zero two percent.

311
00:17:51,880 --> 00:17:55,260
Should we transport Unit 00 into the air
and snipe it from there?

312
00:17:55,260 --> 00:17:56,550
No, that won't work.

313
00:17:56,550 --> 00:17:58,550
It'll all be over if we get shot down
on the approach.

314
00:17:58,550 --> 00:18:00,430
I'll go out there in Unit 01!

315
00:18:00,430 --> 00:18:05,130
No! The target corrodes the pilot's psyche.

316
00:18:05,130 --> 00:18:08,900
<i>Fight now, we must avoid
the. corrosion oi Unit 01.</i>

317
00:18:08,900 --> 00:18:11,610
Then I just have to keep from getting hit, right?!

318
00:18:11,610 --> 00:18:12,900
Your success is not guaranteed.

319
00:18:12,900 --> 00:18:15,150
But at this rate, Asuka will...

320
00:18:15,150 --> 00:18:18,450
I don't care. Rei, go down into Dogma
and use the Lance.

321
00:18:18,450 --> 00:18:20,120
The Lance of Longinus?!

322
00:18:20,120 --> 00:18:21,670
Ikari, that is...

323
00:18:21,670 --> 00:18:26,380
We cannot reach the target's AT Field in orbit,
and that's the only way to bring it down.

324
00:18:26,380 --> 00:18:27,830
Hurry!

325
00:18:27,830 --> 00:18:32,420
But contact between an Eva and Adam
might cause the Third Impact!

326
00:18:32,420 --> 00:18:33,750
It's far too dangerous!

327
00:18:33,750 --> 00:18:35,850
Commander Ikari, please don't do this!

328
00:18:38,100 --> 00:18:40,690
A lie, so it was a deception.

329
00:18:40,690 --> 00:18:44,270
Contact with an Angel was not the cause
of the Second Impact then.

330
00:18:44,270 --> 00:18:48,030
Central Dogma, levels ten to fifteen
have been unlocked.

331
00:18:48,530 --> 00:18:52,210
Unit 00 has passed through
the sixth trench of the Malebolge.

332
00:18:52,210 --> 00:18:55,530
Levels sixteen to twenty
have now been unlocked.

333
00:18:58,240 --> 00:19:02,470
So the Third Impact won't happen.
At least, not because of this.

334
00:19:02,470 --> 00:19:05,840
Then what caused the Second Impact?

335
00:19:12,260 --> 00:19:14,960
Ikari, are we not getting ahead of ourselves?

336
00:19:14,960 --> 00:19:18,180
The Committee has already started
mass-producing the Eva series.

337
00:19:18,180 --> 00:19:20,010
This is our chance, Fuyutsuki.

338
00:19:20,010 --> 00:19:21,800
But this is...

339
00:19:21,800 --> 00:19:24,230
We cannot turn back time,

340
00:19:24,230 --> 00:19:27,020
but we do have the power to spur it onward.

341
00:19:31,280 --> 00:19:33,800
The old men will not stand for this!

342
00:19:33,800 --> 00:19:37,280
We must finish everything before
Seele begins to act.

343
00:19:39,120 --> 00:19:42,780
It would be unwise for us
to lose Unit 02 right now.

344
00:19:42,780 --> 00:19:47,820
That may be, but using the Lance of Longinus
without Seele's permission will be troublesome.

345
00:19:47,820 --> 00:19:51,870
A reason need only exist.
Anything beyond that is insignificant.

346
00:19:51,870 --> 00:19:55,830
A reason? What you're looking for
is an excuse, isn't it?

347
00:19:55,830 --> 00:19:58,710
Brain waves of Unit 02 pilot have
dropped to zero point zero six!

348
00:19:58,710 --> 00:20:00,720
Life support reaching a critical point!

349
00:20:00,720 --> 00:20:03,390
Unit 00 has passed through Number 2,
emerging on surface.

350
00:20:11,860 --> 00:20:13,770
So, that's the Lance of Longinus.

351
00:20:13,770 --> 00:20:15,730
Unit 00, prepared to throw.

352
00:20:15,730 --> 00:20:17,900
Target confirmed. Adjustment for errors made.

353
00:20:17,900 --> 00:20:19,400
Beginning countdown.

354
00:20:19,400 --> 00:20:21,070
T-minus ten seconds.

355
00:20:21,070 --> 00:20:22,490
Eight...

356
00:20:22,490 --> 00:20:23,740
Seven...

357
00:20:23,740 --> 00:20:24,860
Six...

358
00:20:24,860 --> 00:20:26,070
Five...

359
00:20:26,070 --> 00:20:27,330
Four...

360
00:20:27,330 --> 00:20:28,490
Three...

361
00:20:28,490 --> 00:20:29,490
Two...

362
00:20:29,490 --> 00:20:30,450
One...

363
00:20:30,450 --> 00:20:31,880
Zero!

364
00:20:44,970 --> 00:20:46,550
Target has been destroyed.

365
00:20:46,550 --> 00:20:48,600
Eva Unit 02 disengaged.

366
00:20:48,600 --> 00:20:50,310
What about the Lance of Longinus?

367
00:20:50,310 --> 00:20:52,060
It broke the first astronautical velocity.

368
00:20:52,060 --> 00:20:54,390
It is currently moving into lunar orbit.

369
00:20:54,390 --> 00:20:56,520
Recovering it will be nearly impossible.

370
00:20:56,520 --> 00:21:00,910
Yes, at present, we do not have the means
to bring back that much mass.

371
00:21:09,330 --> 00:21:12,080
Unit 02 is in good condition.
Readings currently at normal levels.

372
00:21:12,080 --> 00:21:14,000
Bring the Eva back to Cage 2.

373
00:21:14,000 --> 00:21:16,470
Please use Route 67.

374
00:21:17,180 --> 00:21:18,460
What about Asuka?

375
00:21:18,460 --> 00:21:20,550
Pilot's life signs confirmed.

376
00:21:20,550 --> 00:21:23,900
Quarantine due to the contamination
has been removed.

377
00:21:23,900 --> 00:21:25,470
I see.

378
00:21:26,720 --> 00:21:34,850
DO NOT ENTER

379
00:21:40,370 --> 00:21:41,940
I'm glad for you, Asuka.

380
00:21:42,150 --> 00:21:44,860
Shut up! There's nothing to be glad about!

381
00:21:44,860 --> 00:21:48,160
Of all the people, she had to be
the one to save me!

382
00:21:48,160 --> 00:21:50,740
I had to be saved by HER!

383
00:21:50,740 --> 00:21:54,170
I would've rather died than be saved by her!

384
00:21:54,660 --> 00:21:57,250
I hate it! I hate it! I hate everyone!

385
00:21:57,250 --> 00:21:58,080
I hate everyone so much!

386
00:21:58,120 --> 00:22:00,790
TO BE CONTINUED

387
00:23:06,230 --> 00:23:07,070
PREVIEW

388
00:23:07,070 --> 00:23:09,650
Eva Unit 00 is possessed
and violated by an Angel.

389
00:23:09,650 --> 00:23:13,870
Rei chooses death of her own will in order
to protect Shinji from the Angel's corrosion.

390
00:23:13,870 --> 00:23:18,370
She disappears along with New Tokyo-S,
turning into light and heat.

391
00:23:18,370 --> 00:23:19,910
Next time: "Tears"

392
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:21,250
TEARS
